  "summary": "Technical professional with a thirst for learning and sharing knowledge. I spend my working hours developing software and analyzing data for Microsoft Edge, while my evenings are spent working on a passion project called Farm.\n\nIn my years at Microsoft I have led our team in building insights to customer pain points and developing tooling to help drive those insights to solutions. The job entails a load of cross team collaboration to pull otherwise disparate data points together into unified views.\n\nAt Farm I enjoy an expanded architectural development role that focuses on stringing together various bits of technology to achieve our goal of building a community of land stewards. Here I help manage and develop everything from deployment to POC tech integrations like Web3 based authentication & Plaid integration.\n\nCurrent languages and suites: C++, Typescript, C#, Express, ADO, Notion, Jarvis, Kusto, Presto, Next.js, React, Solidity & Node.",
